{"check":"execution-ref-precedence","checkedDigest":"a61066170e1fd1a26a544314b3cfbe73ad2e89aa42f4109a3e79610e515d0a71","checkedPaths":["TASKS.md","bin/ai-memory-route","bin/ai-memory-route-test","bin/ai-policy-lint","config/ai/memory-router.json","config/ai/project-memory/tokophi.md"],"detail":"The first draft gave a trigger-matched project entry a flat +20, reaching 110 against execution refs at STATUS 100 and TASKS/current.json 95. Reproduced by the reviewer: \"tokophi domain dns status\" displaced current.json in favour of tokophi-domain-status.md, inverting this router docstring rule that repository truth is authoritative. Priority is now two bands under 95 \u2014 triggered max(94-index,91), untriggered max(90-index,70) \u2014 so a trigger still outranks every untriggered sibling but never repository evidence. Verified: the same query returns STATUS.md and current.json again.","eventHash":"ca3e87fce6e38b2ef6dd7db0fe7c041c13a275a98d7a5bcdbf30950ff8ee785f","eventId":"bf97267eeac548d7ac6641a702376616","executed":null,"head":"80513a64572e50d2f3511467888d878c5095cc63","prevEventHash":"e6a736c33be89148e5bb6853dd1db2b7f6458816f17dc18c9c00b6448fc9dc87","runId":"RUN-20260904T043920Z-5912bda0","state":null,"status":"PASS","time":"2026-09-04T04:54:35Z","type":"verification"}
